---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Quaestor is the multi-tenant AR/AP ledger for teams that love clean books: observe, record, and prove every balance without moving or holding money."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b141f" />
    <meta
      http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
      content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests"
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://quaestor-ledger.github.io/" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Quaestor: Love the Ledge" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Ride the flow and trust the ledger. Quaestor observes, records, and proves without moving or holding money."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://quaestor-ledger.github.io/" />
    <meta
      property="og:image"
      content="https://quaestor-ledger.github.io/hero-love-the-ledge.webp"
    />
    <meta
      property="og:image:alt"
      content="A surfer rides a curling wave of banknotes and coins beneath a quasar star."
    />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <title>Quaestor: Love the Ledge — Auditable AR/AP ledger</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header fleet-nav-enhanced">
      <a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="Quaestor Ledger home">
        <span aria-hidden="true">Q</span>
        <strong>Quaestor Ledger</strong>
      </a>
      <nav class="fleet-desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="#principles">Principles</a>
        <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/quaestor-ledger">GitHub</a>
      <a href="#access">Access</a><a href="https://user.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">Log in</a><a href="https://auth.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">Sign up</a></nav><details class="fleet-mobile-nav"><summary>Menu</summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="#access">Access</a><a href="https://user.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">User log in</a><a href="https://org.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">Organization access</a><a href="https://auth.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">Sign up</a><a href="https://github.com/quaestor-ledger">Source</a></nav></details>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Multi-tenant AR/AP ledger</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">
            <span>Quaestor:</span>
            <strong>Love the Ledge</strong>
          </h1>
          <p class="surf-line">Ride the flow. Trust the ledger.</p>
          <p class="lede">
            Quaestor records what is owed and what was paid elsewhere, giving
            teams an auditable ledger and operational evidence without
            initiating transfers, holding funds, or becoming a payment rail.
          </p>
          <div class="actions" aria-label="Project links">
            <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/quaestor-ledger">
              Explore the repositories
            </a>
            <a
              class="button secondary"
              href="https://github.com/quaestor-ledger/quaestor-ledger-server.rs"
            >
              Review the ledger server
            </a>
          </div>
          <ul class="hero-proof" aria-label="Quaestor product qualities">
            <li>Auditable</li>
            <li>Tenant-scoped</li>
            <li>Non-custodial</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-visual">
          <div class="hero-art-frame">
            <img
              src="/hero-love-the-ledge.webp"
              width="1440"
              height="960"
              alt="Illustration of a surfer on a five-point-star surfboard riding a curling wave of banknotes and coins, with a bright quasar star sparkling at the crest."
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            Stay balanced when the books get gnarly.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section id="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Operating model</p>
          <h2 id="principles-title">Observe, record, and prove.</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">
            A ledger with a deliberately narrow boundary and a clear line of evidence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <article>
            <h3>Observe</h3>
            <p>
              Ingest provider and application events through explicit,
              tenant-scoped interfaces.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Record</h3>
            <p>
              Preserve double-entry facts, membership decisions, and audit
              evidence in the system of record.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Prove</h3>
            <p>
              Expose reproducible balances, invariants, and tamper-evident
              verification without taking custody.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="architecture" class="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p>
          <h2 id="architecture-title">Identity and authorization stay separate</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flow" role="list" aria-label="Authorization flow">
          <div role="listitem">
            <span>1</span>
            <strong>Shared Auth</strong>
            <p>Establishes identity, active session state, and assurance.</p>
          </div>
          <div role="listitem">
            <span>2</span>
            <strong>Quaestor grants</strong>
            <p>Authorize exact tenants and billing scopes in Quaestor Postgres.</p>
          </div>
          <div role="listitem">
            <span>3</span>
            <strong>Ledger operations</strong>
            <p>Apply tenant-local policy and preserve reviewable evidence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="boundary">
          A valid identity token never grants access to a tenant by itself.
        </p>
      </section>

<section class="fleet-access" id="access" aria-labelledby="fleet-access-title"><div class="fleet-access-head"><p class="fleet-access-kicker">Product access</p><h2 id="fleet-access-title">Public context here. Account work in the right application.</h2><p class="fleet-access-intro">Quaestor Ledger's marketing site remains public. Authenticated tenant-scoped ledger review and operational evidence is separated into individual, organization, and account-creation boundaries.</p></div><div class="fleet-access-grid"><article><span>INDIVIDUAL</span><h3>Your workspace</h3><p>Return to personal activity, saved context, and work owned by your account.</p><a href="https://user.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">User log in ↗</a></article><article><span>ORGANIZATION</span><h3>Team operations</h3><p>Open shared membership, policy, and organization-scoped work.</p><a href="https://org.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">Organization access ↗</a></article><article><span>SHARED AUTH</span><h3>Create an account</h3><p>Start through the dedicated authentication boundary before entering the product.</p><a href="https://auth.quaestor-ledger.github.io/">Sign up ↗</a></article></div></section>
</main>

    <footer>
      <p>Quaestor: Love the Ledge. Observe, record, and prove. It never moves or holds money.</p>
      <a href="https://github.com/quaestor-ledger">github.com/quaestor-ledger</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .fleet-nav-enhanced { position: sticky !important; top: 0; z-index: 200; isolation: isolate; }
  .fleet-mobile-nav { display: none; position: relative; margin-left: auto; }
  .fleet-mobile-nav summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: .62rem .8rem; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: .45rem; font: 700 .72rem/1 system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .fleet-mobile-nav summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .fleet-mobile-nav nav { position: absolute; right: 0; top: calc(100% + .55rem); min-width: 15rem; display: grid; gap: .25rem; padding: .75rem; background: #111827; color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); box-shadow: 0 1.4rem 3rem rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
  .fleet-mobile-nav a { padding: .7rem .8rem; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .fleet-desktop-nav { display: none !important; }
    .fleet-mobile-nav { display: block; }
  }
</style>

<style>
  .fleet-access { padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) max(4vw, calc((100% - 76rem) / 2)); border-block: 1px solid currentColor; }
  .fleet-access-head { max-width: 48rem; }
  .fleet-access-kicker { margin: 0 0 .8rem; font: 750 .72rem/1.4 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .7; }
  .fleet-access h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.04em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .fleet-access-intro { max-width: 46rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 0; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; opacity: .78; }
  .fleet-access-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .fleet-access-grid article { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: .8rem; }
  .fleet-access-grid span { font: 750 .68rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; opacity: .66; }
  .fleet-access-grid h3 { margin: 1.5rem 0 .65rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .fleet-access-grid p { min-height: 4.8rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: .76; }
  .fleet-access-grid a { font-weight: 750; color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .25rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .fleet-access-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .fleet-access-grid p { min-height: 0; }
  }
</style>
